            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Representatives of this class are for example: vacuum-tanker or pump-tanker. Calculations are based on a tanker of 2200 kg, 2200 hours useful life and 0.33 repair factor. For exact results, module should only be used if lifetime and repair factor of the balanced machinery are within a narrow range of the values the module is based on. The functional unit is 1kg slurry tanker during its lifetime.;
